<title>RUSSIA: Russian June industry output rises 2.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russian June industry output rises 2.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian June industrial production rose 2.0 percent year-on-year and was 1.4-percent higher than May, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Industrial output in the first six months of 1997 rose 0.8 percent year-on-year to 761 trillion roubles ($131.8 billion).</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	JUNE 97    MAY 97    JUNE 97</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	  +1.4	-4.1	-0.3</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    +2.0	+0.2	-6.8</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520 ($ = 5773 Russian Roubles)</p>
</text>
